        "subject": "LU-21176 tests: skip sanity 230q fixed check on old clients",
        "message": "LU-21176 tests: skip sanity 230q fixed check on old clients\n\nSince LU-17810 the MDS no longer sets LMV_HASH_FLAG_FIXED on\nmigrate; lfs does it on the client side. With a new MDS and a\nclient older than that change, \"lfs migrate -m 0\" collapses the\ndirectory to a plain one and getdirstripe -H reports \"none\"\ninstead of \"crush,fixed\". Run that part of the test only when\nthe client lfs sets the flag, or the MDS still does it.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial clientversion=2.15 testlist=sanity env=ONLY=230q\nFixes: 392f558f40 (\"LU-17810 dne: dir restripe without fixed hash flag\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I986b330bd1427540060dac745e4e3ad9640f2338\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
